==Trivia==
* He used to offer the assassin elite skill [[Assault Enchantments]], and was the only hero skill trainer to offer an elite skill.
* Shares the skill [[Empowerment]] with [[Pikin]], making him one of only a few hero skill trainers that teaches the same skill as another hero skill trainer (the final hero skill trainer with this trait is [[Libeh]], who also shares a skill with Pikin).
